Build without Rust: drop the jsrust crate and Rust build rules, and
replace the encoding_rs routines in mfbt with C++ implementations based
on ICU, which then has to be linked unconditionally.
Adapted from the MongoDB SpiderMonkey fork, branch esr128.11-cpp-only:
https://github.com/mongodb-forks/spidermonkey/commit/b22965a1a2
https://github.com/mongodb-forks/spidermonkey/commit/f769d85aa3
Unlike the fork, also drop bindgen.configure, whose cbindgen check is
fatal. The fork builds without the Intl API; with it, intl/bidi only
generates the cbindgen header for the Rust unicode-bidi crate, so drop
that directory and use the ICU4C backend of intl/components' Bidi.

